{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pepgent/soroi/pulls/260","id":5104084365,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUW8ics8AAAABMDoljQ","html_url":"https://github.com/Pepgent/soroi/pull/260","diff_url":"https://github.com/Pepgent/soroi/pull/260.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Pepgent/soroi/pull/260.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pepgent/soroi/issues/260","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pepgent/soroi/pulls/260/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pepgent/soroi/pulls/260/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pepgent/soroi/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pepgent/soroi/issues/260/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Pepgent/soroi/statuses/89301e4f0b3c899200874cf29c707ca4adc80073","number":260,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"以真实 transcript 验证五类发行定制","user":{"login":"RiriAgent","id":39219425,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MjE5NDI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39219425?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiriAgent","html_url":"https://github.com/RiriAgent","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiriAgent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiriAgent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiriAgent/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiriAgent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiriAgent/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiriAgent/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiriAgent/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiriAgent/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiriAgent/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #224\n\n## 摘要\n\n本 PR 为实际发行 tar 增加 prepare、只读 native observer 和 verifier，沿用一次完整 fresh-HOME A0，逐项判定 extension、agent、skill、rule、settings 五类实际行为。完整 A0 当前仍未通过；本文不以 CI、prepare 或静态 review 替代该验收。\n\n## 实现说明\n\nprepare 请求已安装公开 launcher 的 `plugin list --json`，从实际注册根链接真实 `omp-soroi/node`，写入 Program21→42、只读观察 overlay 和有限配方。observer 直接使用 host-native modules，通过 `appendEntry` 记录父子 native prompt、model、settings 与 discovery，不复制产品正文、不替换工具。verify 复用既有 D8 schema 和 `activeBranch`，关联真实工具调用/结果、非空 Program CallReport、实际 worker/definition/model/return、skill URI 正文、五条产品规则与 child none 覆盖。\n\n真实 R2 暴露 bulk `prompt + CR` 在启动时留在输入编辑器的问题。本次 head `fed10f0a3e080beecb353554b53e9aa1e7d22da7` 删除该输入方式，使用 omp 既有 interactive positional initial prompt：全部 flags 在前，配方以 `--` 和一条原样完整 prompt 结束。根 native `agent_end` 仅用于 PTY 同步；驱动随后发送 `/exit`，观察 echo，再独立发送 Enter。verifier 要求 native root 恰有一条原样 user message，防止 `/exit` 误入模型后仍通过。详细可执行契约见[本 PR 评论](https://github.com/Pepgent/soroi/pull/260#issuecomment-6553818587)。\n\n验收工具留在发行外层，不进入 runtime customization workspace；observer 原样加载，只有 prepare/verify 编译为 Bun CLI。测试者继续独占 `e2e/pty/*` 与 [PR266](https://github.com/Pepgent/soroi/pull/266)，本 PR 不修改该驱动、不编写 role/skill/rule 内容，也不使用 hash 验收。\n\n## 变更预演（Layer 1）\n\n不适用——本 PR 不声明或 apply 基础设施。共享 S1 store/mux 保持原实例与持久卷；完整 A0 的 clean-HOME gate、凭据注入、PTY、脱敏与清理由测试驱动拥有。\n\n## 落地核对（Layer 2）\n\n[Release CI41276109573](https://github.com/Pepgent/soroi/actions/runs/41276109573) 的实际下载 tar 位于 `/Users/mouriya/Ext/work/orbstack/pepgent-soroi-e2e/releases/soroi-b2ad3470e334eed4b89b6b51d25426e333fcaaf0de1e739fb42be647767fd4c8.tar`，manifest source version 为 `c05de99fc98fbb9155da01cb585064323b8bfb4c`。文件名仅定位产物，不承担 hash 证据。\n\n该 tar 的 installer 返回 `/home/agent/.local/bin/soroi` 及安装树真实 central settings 路径；实际 bundle prepare 生成 `/tmp/soroi-dist02-corrected-ci-41276109573/out/recipe.json`，其 `ompArgs` 末尾为 `--` 和一条完整 prompt，steps 为根 turn-end → `/exit` → 实际 echo → 独立 Enter。这些观察证明新发行中已落地公开入口配方，不证明模型或五类行为通过。\n\n## 启动 / 运行时顺序（Layer 3）\n\n登记的 disposable Linux upstream consumer 使用 UID1000 和独立空 HOME，实际执行 tar 自带 installer → 公开 registry 查询 → prepare，exit0。原始输出依次为 `clean_home=true`、安装118个 packages、安装记录 JSON、`phase:prepared`。日志为 `/var/folders/8w/2m72zhg91gq6cr9_ngx6l0q40000gn/T/pi-unified-exec-98237-49-c2929e3d.log`。该 preparation smoke 无 provider token、无模型 turn、无 Program 执行。\n\n## 端到端业务行为（Layer 4）\n\n完整五类 A0 **尚未验证**。先前 R1 的 staged 文件 ownership 失败已由驱动 owner 修正；R2 实际完成 installer/prepare 后，初始 prompt 未提交，240s 无 assistant/tool，最终清理成功但 verifier 未运行，故不计通过。失败证据由[驱动 PR 评论](https://github.com/Pepgent/soroi/pull/266#issuecomment-6553625071)保留。\n\n测试者已收到当前实际新 tar 与配方，将按[issue235](https://github.com/Pepgent/soroi/issues/235)运行同一次完整 fresh-HOME Linux A0。验收必须同时包含真实非空 CallReport21→42、安装 worker 的 actual handback、五类 native 谓词与正常清理；marker、model prose、空 calls、旧 PR234 记录或本地重建均不作为替代证据。最终证据到位后再替换本节、归档原始材料并提交合并裁决。\n\n## 卫生检查\n\n代码完整写完后，`bun run --cwd e2e check` 成功；Release CI 成功。这些只作辅助检查，不构成业务证据。\n\n## 分析\n\n实际新 tar 已证明安装和生成配方的公开调用链可执行；该观察未覆盖模型初始 turn、真实 Program 或 worker handback。此次修正把初始语义输入交回 omp 已有 post-init interactive 路径，而不增加 banner readiness、sleep 或替代 RPC。PR 当前保持 open，等待完整真实 A0，不将前置 [PR239](https://github.com/Pepgent/soroi/pull/239) 和 [PR234](https://github.com/Pepgent/soroi/pull/234) 已有验收冒称本次通过。\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-01T03:42:07Z","updated_at":"2026-11-01T05:20:04Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"a5ac6d81ff67d2b9a4cf8b18fd7defb6fe45339f","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Pepgent:eng/install-check-224","ref":"eng/install-check-224","repo":{"id":1366237810,"node_id":"R_kgDOUW8icg","name":"soroi","full_name":"Pepgent/soroi","owner":{"login":"Pepgent","id":327843718,"node_id":"O_kgDOE4p_hg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/327843718?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pepgent","html_url":"https://github.com/Pepgent","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pepgent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pepgent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pepgent/gists{/gist_id}","s